Stage optimization problem for given input s_t = (x_t, omega_t) is in the following form : 

				 h_t(s_t) = c_t*x_t + min d_t*u_t
				                      s.t. D_t u_t = b_t - C_t x_t,

with the following linear dynamics: x_{t+} = a_{t+} + A_{t+}x_t + B_{t+}u_t.

